dentify when he appears in a room with dim yellow lighting.**\n✅ Confirmed. In frames **0409–0411**, the lighting is noticeably dimmer and warmer (yellowish), especially compared to the brighter daylight scenes earlier. He is in a hallway or bedroom area.\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Determine what clothing change occurs.**\n✅ He is **still wearing the same gray and white raglan shirt** in frames 0409–0411 — **no change to a black and white patterned garment**.\n\n- In frame 0409, he is wearing a **white hoodie or sweatshirt** with a **white hat** (possibly a sun hat or novelty hat), but **not black and white patterned**.\n- The hoodie is plain white with a small red logo (visible in frame 0410), not patterned.\n- No black and white patterned garment appears anywhere in the provided frames.\n\n➡️ **Clothing change does NOT match “black and white patterned garment.”**\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Verify all 6 criteria:**\n1. **Colorful long-sleeve shirt** → ❌ No. Shirt is gray/white — neutral tones.\n2. **Short hair/stubble** → ✅ Yes.\n3. **Inside vehicle/RV** → ✅ Yes.\n4. **Near electrical control module** → ✅ Yes (microwave/oven area).\n5. **Left hand raised while introducing** → ✅ Yes (frames 0270–0271).\n6. **Room with dim yellow lighting** → ✅ Yes (frames 0409–0411).\n\n➡️ **Only 5 out of 6 criteria are met. The critical failure is #1 (colorful shirt) and #6’s clothing change (not black/white patterned).**\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Temporal sequence:**\n- The “colorful shirt” scene (actually gray/white) occurs **first** (frames 0269–0274).\n- The dim yellow lighting scene occurs **later** (frames 0409–0411), where he is in a **different outfit** (white hoodie + hat), **not** a black and white patterned garment.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Verdict:\n**Answer '3' is incorrect.** The man never wears a black and white patterned garment. He wears a gray/white raglan shirt (not colorful) and later a plain white hoodie. There is no visual or contextual evidence to support the claim of a “black and whi